      "math_structure": {
        "type": "rational_integration",
        "template": "有理函数的实积分通过留数定理计算",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "积分值",
          "steps": [
            "$f(z) = \\frac{1}{(z^2+1)(z^2+4)}$ 的奇点为 $z = \\pm i, \\pm 2i$",
            "在上半平面的奇点为 $z = i$ 和 $z = 2i$",
            "$\\text{Res}(f, i) = \\lim_{z \\to i}(z-i)\\frac{1}{(z+i)(z^2+4)} = \\frac{1}{2i(i^2+4)} = \\frac{1}{2i\\cdot 3} = \\frac{1}{6i}$",
            "$\\text{Res}(f, 2i) = \\lim_{z \\to 2i}(z-2i)\\frac{1}{(z^2+1)(z+2i)} = \\frac{1}{(4i^2+1)(4i)} = \\frac{1}{(-3)(4i)} = -\\frac{1}{12i}$",
            "$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{(x^2+1)(x^2+4)}dx = 2\\pi i(\\frac{1}{6i} - \\frac{1}{12i}) = 2\\pi i \\cdot \\frac{1}{12i} = \\frac{\\pi}{6}$"
          ]
        }
      ],
