      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "积分值",
          "steps": [
            "考虑 $f(z) = \\frac{ze^{iz}}{z^2+a^2}$，奇点为 $z = \\pm ai$",
            "在上半平面，奇点为 $z = ai$",
            "$\\text{Res}(f, ai) = \\frac{ai \\cdot e^{i(ai)}}{2ai} = \\frac{e^{-a}}{2}$",
            "$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} \\frac{xe^{ix}}{x^2+a^2}dx = 2\\pi i \\cdot \\frac{e^{-a}}{2} = \\pi i e^{-a}$",
            "$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} \\frac{x\\sin x}{x^2+a^2}dx = \\text{Im}(\\pi i e^{-a}) = \\pi e^{-a}$",
            "**答：$\\pi e^{-a}$**"
